  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/6104442ed30596ef4d7795d3186273f68d796ea4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:5.491ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle a=1}"></span>, i.e., the vertical diagram. This corresponds to the sign representation. It has degree <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle -1}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo>&#x2212;<!-- − --></mo>
