</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/a25115739469707c4758b189fe310a750092a80a" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:2.972ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle (1)}"></span> for even permutations and <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle (-1)nb}">
  <semantics>
