        <mo>&#x2212;<!-- − --></mo>
        <mn>1</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle a=n-1}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/7ac8bcfccd155d49e6a063b2dd4d6e43ebac31a2" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.505ex; width:9.726ex; height:2.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle a=n-1}"></span>. This corresponds to the standard representation. This is the nontrivial irreducible component of the representation of the symmetric group on a <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle n}">
  <semantics>
