  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9f049ac28d4ac8097b625f9d71c1f22b2ebd1bc4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:2.643ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{n}}"></span>.
</p><p>By <a href="/wiki/Frobenius_reciprocity" title="Frobenius reciprocity">Frobenius reciprocity</a>, the multiplicity of <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle \varphi }">
