</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/69020b753c87f88ea4cd38dfea10f6fb4f286fa3" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:4.744ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S_{n-1}}"></span> equals the multiplicity of <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle \psi }">
