<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Asymptotic_representation_theory">Asymptotic representation theory</span></h2>
<p><tt>Further information: <a href="/w/index.php?title=Asymptotic_representation_theory_of_symmetric_groups&amp;action=edit&amp;redlink=1" class="new" title="Asymptotic representation theory of symmetric groups (page does not exist)">asymptotic representation theory of symmetric groups</a></tt>
</p><p>Everywhere below, <span class="mwe-math-element"><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"  alttext="{\displaystyle n}">
